+### Specialized Patch Boundary Rendering
+A specialized algorithm for rendering patch boundaries that is an order of magnitude faster and more memory efficient than the previous general algorithm [S3, unofficial]. The optimizations save on memory by a factor of ten [S3, unofficial]. The new specialized algorithm is an order of magnitude faster than the previous general algorithm used for patch boundaries [S3, unofficial].
